msgid "One caveat: waking a pooled VT with `LockSupport.unpark()` queues it on the carrier's *local* queue, while `Thread.start()` uses the *external* one (`VirtualThread.java`), so the 3% may be the queue rather than the allocation; nothing here separates them."
